<title>ITALY: Italy to issue variable rate U.S. dlr bond.</title>
<headline>Italy to issue variable rate U.S. dlr bond.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Republic of Italy plans to issue a variable rate bond denominated in U.S. dollars, the Treasury said in a statement.</p>
<p>The statement said Lehman Brothers and HSBC Markets Ltd would lead the operation.</p>
<p>It gave no further details.</p>
<p>-- Rome newsroom +396 6782501</p>
